          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>接入联网大模型，支持上下文记忆与联网搜索</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 86 }}>云端部署</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>阿里云 Ubuntu 环境，公网可直接访问</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 86 }}>GIS 可视化</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>离线瓦片、多图层叠加、风险分级渲染</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 86 }}>工程规范</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>界面风格统一，纳入 Git + GitHub 版本管理</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 86 }}>灾害模块</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>完成专业化重构，可与易损性成果衔接</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, borderLeft: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 36 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>下一阶段：把三个专项模块做通</Text>
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 86 }}>重车通行</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>路径规划算法在真实路网跑通，设计功能界面</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 86 }}>灾害对接</Text>
